    <projectSourceUrl>https://github.com/asiimwe3/school-report-maker</projectSourceUrl>
    <summary>Offline school report card system for Ugandan secondary schools.</summary>
    <description>Builds report cards from teacher-entered marks with Uganda A-E grading, aggregates, division and automatic remarks. Runs fully offline on Windows.</description>
    <tags>education school reports uganda offline report-cards</tags>
